 ## Changelog
+- `done` shadow cone: the umbra an item or mob throws through the air, from the object to the ground (written WITHOUT a Rust toolchain: not compiled, not run; no test, the logic is a draw call and two constants; no FPS numbers):
+    - `gpu/pipeline.rs` `vs_cone`/`fs_cone` + `cone_pipeline`, `lib.rs` `CONE_COPIES`: after the entity mesh (and before the water), the same buffer is drawn `CONE_COPIES` (40) more times as instances 1..=40, each slid `CONE_STEP` (0.2 block) further from the sun (`u.sun.xyz` is the direction toward it), as a black layer of alpha `CONE_ALPHA` (0.04) x shadow strength, both faces, depth test on, no depth write. Along a view ray the layers stack with the path through the swept volume (about 10% seen across a 0.25 item, up to ~95% looking straight along the light), and the ground cuts the cone where it lands. It is Minkowski-sum-by-instancing, no silhouette maths.
+    - Knobs: `CONE_ALPHA` is the darkness, `CONE_STEP` x `CONE_COPIES` the reach. Ceilings (ponytail): a tall mob under a low sun has a longer umbra than 8 blocks and is cut short; every copy draws the whole entity buffer (fill cost scales with copies x entities on screen); the cone is a parallel prism, a point light like the diagram's would need a per-copy scale.
 - `done` water depth (written WITHOUT a Rust toolchain: not compiled, not run; the existing `water_has_its_own_indices` test gains 2 asserts, not run): water showed its bed at every depth (flat 0.54 alpha). `mesh::build_split` packs the water column under each water face (cells, <= 15) into the integer part of the vertex `light` (`light * WATER_LIGHT + depth`, no new vertex attribute); `fs_water` unpacks it and uses alpha `max(0.54, 1 - e^(-0.35 d))` blended toward 1 at grazing angles (`graze`), with the colour tinted darker and bluer by the same absorption. UNVERIFIED: constants tuned by eye against a shader-pack screenshot. ponytail: the column is counted straight down, not along the view ray; no sky reflection, no refraction.
 - `done` chest storage (host-checked: `chest_screen_clicks_and_layout`, `chests_follow_the_java`, `chests_pick_their_tile_from_the_neighbours`, the extended `chunk_and_level_round_trip` and `populate_matches_java` pass; `lib.rs` not compiled; 3 older tests (`leaves_do_not_shade_like_a_roof`, `table_fills`, `drops_inventory_and_item_physics`) already fail on the uploaded tree, untouched):
